# LeafSeverityCalculator Release Notes

## 0.0.9a1 (25 Apr 2026)

* Documented branch split between `main` (modern NumPy/`numpy-rolling-ball`) and `OpenCV-based` (legacy OpenCV/`opencv-rolling-ball`) implementations.
* Clarified that both branches preserve the same user workflow (illumination correction before severity, aspect-ratio-preserving resize, same threshold logic).
* Clarified repository layout and why `leafseveritycalculator/README.rst` and `leafseveritycalculator/LICENSE` coexist with root-level docs.

## 0.0.1 (04 Mar 2025)

* Initial release
